# OpenClaw doc-drift-agent: daily scheduled README drift review.
# Cron is UTC; runs at 01:00 UTC daily. The wrapper enforces the 12h
# manual-run suppression gate before invoking the agent, which reviews the
# whole README set in one pass.
#
# Deployed to: /etc/cron.d/openclaw-doc-drift (root:root, mode 644).
0 1 * * * openclaw /home/openclaw/.openclaw/scripts/doc-drift-cron.sh
